":"Jul 2005","type":"budget","text":"Loan #7 ($10,000).","population":18590,"money":6172},{"t":"2026-10-16T16:16:37Z","date":"Jul 2005","type":"build","text":"North mixed district and factory cells below road y97 (trip check: factories 73%, only 4 weak tiles).","population":18590,"money":6172},{"t":"2026-10-16T16:19:32Z","date":"Dec 2006","type":"budget","text":"Loan #8 ($10,000).","population":21830,"money":7774},{"t":"2026-10-16T16:19:32Z","date":"Dec 2006","type":"build","text":"Airport + two shop cells south of district 6 (shop land short, shop cap at ~20,000).","population":21830,"money":7774},{"t":"2026-10-16T16:19:32Z","date":"Dec 2006","type":"commentary","text":"Dec 2006: 21,830 people - the best city ever at this date (attempt 2 reached ~21,000 around 2007-08). Unemployment 9%.","population":21830,"money":7774},{"t":"2026-10-16T16:23:43Z","date":"Jul 2007","type":"build","text":"Airport + 2 shop cells (loan #8); coal plant (68,48) and 6 south pumps (power/water under 10%).","population":23610,"money":1255}]